  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-24",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "刚出炉的咖啡  (Freshly Brewed Coffee)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xiaoye": "小叶"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "One month into her administrative job at Xingtian, Bu Xiaogu has mastered brewing coffee for the whole office and gets sent to serve drinks at the ten o'clock production meeting. Listen to their Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "制作娱乐节目并不是一件娱乐的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们要面对最现实的每一天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在进入职场已经一个月了，我明白了一个道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "重点在于用什么样的表情面对折磨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，你泡的咖啡太棒了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "难怪最近斯戴拉连外面的咖啡都不点了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚出炉的热咖啡，请大家享用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "十点有制作会，雷总让你待会儿去送茶水。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "别忘了准备红茶，还有冰美式不加糖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "端茶送水也得先认清公司里的各个部门。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "制作娱乐节目并不是一件娱乐的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Producing entertainment shows is not an entertaining matter at all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们要面对最现实的每一天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They have to face the most realistic everyday challenges.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在进入职场已经一个月了，我明白了一个道理。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now that I have been in the workplace for a month, I understand one truth.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "重点在于用什么样的表情面对折磨。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What matters is what expression you wear when facing hardship.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，你泡的咖啡太棒了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, the coffee you brew is fantastic!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "难怪最近斯戴拉连外面的咖啡都不点了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No wonder Stella has stopped ordering coffee from outside lately.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚出炉的热咖啡，请大家享用。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Freshly brewed hot coffee; please enjoy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "十点有制作会，雷总让你待会儿去送茶水。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is a production meeting at ten, and Director Lei wants you to serve drinks shortly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "别忘了准备红茶，还有冰美式不加糖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do not forget to prepare black tea and the unsweetened iced Americano.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "端茶送水也得先认清公司里的各个部门。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Even serving tea and water means learning every department in the company first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "制作娱乐节目并不是一件娱乐的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "他们要面对最现实的每一天。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "现在进入职场已经一个月了，我明白了一个道理。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "重点在于用什么样的表情面对折磨。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "小谷，你泡的咖啡太棒了！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "难怪最近斯戴拉连外面的咖啡都不点了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "刚出炉的热咖啡，请大家享用。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "十点有制作会，雷总让你待会儿去送茶水。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "别忘了准备红茶，还有冰美式不加糖。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "端茶送水也得先认清公司里的各个部门。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Armed with black tea, unsweetened coffee, and a resilient smile, Xiaogu steps into Xingtian's big production meeting. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
